        <p>Dubai Roof Seal was founded to solve a real problem — too many building owners were being sold repeat patch jobs that never fixed the root cause of their leaks. We built a company around doing it right the first time.</p>
        <p>We serve residential villas, industrial warehouses, commercial buildings, schools and government facilities across all Dubai areas — including Sharjah and Ajman. Our team brings together experienced applicators, site supervisors and project managers who understand the technical demands of waterproofing in the UAE climate.</p>
        <div class="who-points">
