<!-- ═══ VALUES ═══ -->
<section class="values-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="values-intro">
      <span class="label">What Drives Us</span>
      <h2 class="title">Our <span>Core Values</span></h2>
      <p class="body-text">Every decision we make — from the materials we specify to the way we communicate with clients — is guided by these principles.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon navy">🎯</div>
        <h3>Fix It Properly. First Time.</h3>
        <p>We diagnose the root cause — not just the symptom. No temporary patches, no band-aid solutions. We install systems that are built to last in Dubai's extreme climate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon gold">💬</div>
        <h3>Honest Communication</h3>
        <p>We tell you exactly what your roof needs — and what it doesn't. No upselling, no unnecessary work. Our quotes are detailed, transparent and fixed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon teal">🏆</div>
        <h3>Accountability</h3>
        <p>Every job comes with a 5-year written warranty and photo documentation. We stand behind our work — if there's an issue, we come back and fix it. Simple.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon navy">⚡</div>
        <h3>Responsive Service</h3>
        <p>Active leak? We respond within 30 minutes and attend within 24–48 hours. We work weekends and public holidays because leaks don't follow a calendar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon gold">🔬</div>
        <h3>Right Materials for the Right Job</h3>
        <p>EPDM for metal roofs. Torch-on bitumen or liquid PU for flat concrete. Crystalline for tanks. We specify the correct system for your roof type — not whatever is cheapest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon teal">🤝</div>
        <h3>Long-Term Relationships</h3>
        <p>Many of our clients work with us on AMC contracts and repeat projects. We build relationships, not just roofs — and we protect them with consistent quality every time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

