        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">🇦🇪</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Built for Dubai's Climate</h4>
          <p>We understand UAE weather — intense UV, extreme heat, sandstorms, and heavy rain events. Every system we install is specified and applied to perform in these conditions for years, not months.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">📱</div>
