          <p>Villas, warehouses, factories, schools, mosques, shopping centres, petrol stations. Metal, flat concrete, sandwich panel, single-skin — we handle all roof types with the correct specified system.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">⏰</div>
        <div>
          <h4>7 Days a Week — Including Emergencies</h4>
          <p>We operate every day of the week including Fridays and public holidays. For emergency leaks, we prioritise attendance outside normal hours via WhatsApp.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">💰</div>
        <div>
